# IsoRim model: watermill
# Remake after the vanilla WatermillGenerator sprites: timber deck, red-brown house with a gable roof along the axle,
# generator drum behind it, shaft at 1.20 to a trestle in the river. The wheel is watermill_wheel.obj (drawn spinning).
# Generated by tools/make_watermill.py (2026-11-14). One unit = one map cell, +Y up, file -Z = game north (model faces north).
